=== 3. the control falsifies the pooled estimator ===
 ctl2 s100: d8 is PINNED to 0, so the table holds no lattice information at all.
   pooled even-odd over all five siblings = +0.3088
   restricted to reachable d8 = [0]: the odd group is EMPTY -> estimator UNDEFINED
   -> the pooled estimator cannot be computed on the control, so it has no null calibration.

